      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あの兵器を放っておくと\r\nいたずらに戦争が長引く可能性があった。",
        "official_en": "If we had left those weapon emplacements alone, this war could have dragged on that much longer.",
        "real_en": "If we'd left those weapons alone, the war might have dragged on needlessly."
