      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "だが、戦争が泥沼化すれば\r\nいずれ、武器を持たぬものまでもが\r\n犠牲になるだろう。",
        "official_en": "Should this war trudge on, it will be paid for in innocent blood.",
        "real_en": "But if this war drags on, even those who don't bear weapons will eventually become casualties."
