      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ふざけるな……。\r\n戦争に負けたら……俺たちは……。",
        "official_en": "What drivel you speak... It’s already over for us...if we lose...",
        "real_en": "Don't mock us... If we lose this war, we'll..."
