        "official_en_sha256": "de5ae3f446ada54cecfbfcb031290ff3bf9eb6f6e8af1d61abbaad9fb1f8632b"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "もう立つな。\r\nお前たちは誇り高く戦った。\r\n無駄に命を捨てることはない。",
        "official_en": "Stay down. You fought bravely. Do not throw your lives away.",
        "real_en": null
